sn22.95:12.1 starts: When bereft of these
sn22.95:12.2 starts: it lies thrown away,
sn22.95:12.3 starts: senseless,
sn22.95:12.4 starts: a meal for others.
sn22.76:9.1 starts: The adept’s knowledge
sn22.76:9.2 starts: ‘This is the last body.’
sn22.76:9.3 starts: As for the essence of the holy
sn22.76:9.4 starts: they don’t depend on others in that.
sn22.78:3.1 starts: When the Awakened One, through direct knowledge,
sn22.78:3.2 starts: —the Teacher, the person with no peer
sn22.78:3.3 starts: in the world with its devas—
sn22.78:3.4 starts: sets the Dhamma wheel rolling:
sn22.95:11.1 starts: Beginning with the body
sn22.95:11.2 starts: as taught by the One
sn22.95:11.3 starts: When abandoned by three things
sn22.95:11.4 starts: form is rejected, cast aside.
sn22.95:14.1 starts: Thus a monk, persistence aroused,
sn22.95:14.2 starts: should view the aggregates
sn22.95:14.3 starts: mindful,
sn22.95:14.4 starts: alert;
sn35.95:13.1 starts: One’s feelings, born of the form,
sn35.95:13.2 starts: grow numerous,
sn35.95:13.3 starts: Greed & annoyance
sn35.95:13.4 starts: injure one’s mind.
sn35.95:13.5 starts: Thus amassing stress,
sn35.95:13.6 starts: one is said to be far
sn35.95:23.1 starts: One’s feelings, born of the idea,
sn35.95:23.2 starts: grow numerous,
sn35.95:23.3 starts: Greed & annoyance
sn35.95:23.4 starts: injure one’s mind.
sn35.95:23.5 starts: Thus amassing stress,
sn35.95:23.6 starts: one is said to be far
